# ===========================================================================
# 13. Remaining cited-prerequisite edges (roots into the results that use them)
# ===========================================================================
# Chebyshev drives the elementary consistency argument (via the WLLN) and MoM.
prob_chebyshev_ineq consistency
prob_chebyshev_ineq method_of_moments
# conditional Jensen is the engine of Rao-Blackwell's variance drop.
prob_jensen_ineq rao_blackwell_theorem
# continuous mapping: g(theta_hat) inherits consistency / the chi^2 limit.
prob_continuous_mapping mle_invariance
prob_continuous_mapping three_tests_asymptotically_equivalent
prob_continuous_mapping delta_method_standard_error
# a.s. convergence: the SLLN form of MLE consistency and Glivenko-Cantelli.
prob_conv_as glivenko_cantelli
prob_conv_as mle_consistency
# LOTUS: population moments E_theta[X^k] as integrals against the model density.
prob_lotus method_of_moments
prob_lotus exponential_family_moment_identities
# MGF proof of chi^2 shape-additivity and of the chi^2 = Gamma identity.
prob_mgf chi_squared_additivity
prob_mgf chi_squared_distribution
# the CF-based Gaussian-shift limit behind LAN.
prob_characteristic_function le_cam_lan_theory
prob_levy_continuity le_cam_lan_theory
# a mixture-of-experiments is a marginal over which experiment was drawn.
prob_marginal_distribution conditionality_principle
# an estimator / statistic is a random variable / random vector.
prob_random_variable statistic
# Gamma-Poisson conjugacy; Poisson counts feed the GOF statistic.
prob_poisson conjugate_prior
prob_poisson pearson_chi_squared_gof
# the exponential family's canonical instance (rate/scale) and MoM failure.
prob_exponential exponential_family
prob_cauchy_no_mean method_of_moments
# correlation is the population quantity R^2 estimates in simple regression.
prob_correlation r_squared
# uncorrelated-but-dependent errors: what Gauss-Markov's Cov(eps)=sigma^2 I rules out.
prob_independence_factorization bias_of_sample_variance
prob_independence_factorization normal_sample_mean_variance_independence
# continuity of the log-likelihood for the argmax to exist on a compact set.
ra_continuity maximum_likelihood_estimator
# the cited analytic theorem that licenses the interchange-of-d-and-integral hypothesis.
ra_interchange_limit_integral interchange_derivative_integral
# the MVT/Taylor step in the score expansion.
ra_mean_value_theorem mle_asymptotic_normality

# --- credible interval: a posterior-probability region -----------------------
prob_conditional_distribution credible_interval
bayes_estimator credible_interval
